  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Implantacin de la Reforma Pensional</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Pension Reform Implementation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To support the development and implementation of the new pensions system (SDSS) through a Technical Cooperation Loan of US$5 million. Three components have been identified for the development of this program at a cost of US$5.7 app.: 1) Pensions Superintendency starting and regulations making; 2) Analysis of financial viability of the new pensions reform; 3) Plan of promotion and spreading of the new pension system.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES"></narrative>
  </description>
